<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U 1996 results by product area.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U 1996 results by product area.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a breakdown of drug group Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn's sales for calendar 1996 and fourth quarter 1996 by product area.</p>
<p>  (US$ million)		   Fourth quarter	    Full year</p>
<p>					1996     1995	  1996    1995</p>
<p> Infectious disease		178	184	   587     687</p>
<p> Metabolic disease		 168	162	   629     636</p>
<p> Critical care &amp; thrombosis    180	144	   624     580</p>
<p> Central nervous system	  151	149	   569     572</p>
<p> Oncology			    190	136	   630     566</p>
<p> Women's health		    145	141	   554     541</p>
<p> Nutrition			    95	105	   381     399</p>
<p> Ophthalmology			85	 76	   295     296</p>
<p> Other prescription drugs	207	214	   811     833</p>
<p> Consumer health care	    148	151	   710     566</p>
<p> Animal health		     131	102	   413     383</p>
<p> Chemical &amp; contract Mfg	  87	 38	   317     200</p>
<p> Diagnostics			  54	 58	   219     253</p>
<p> Biotech/Biacore*		  121	145	   439     437</p>
<p> Consolidated net sales	1,940    1,805	 7,176   6,949</p>
<p>* Biacore sales included through November 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
